\id PHM - Diiloŋ-nelma cerma-na 
\ide UTF-8 
\h Filemɔ sɛbɛ 
\toc1 Filemɔ sɛbɛ 
\toc2 File. 
\toc3 File. 
\mt2 Polŋ nyɛgãaŋ sɛbɛ maŋ hã 
\mt1 Filemɔ‑i 
\imt1 Nelmuoyamma 
\ip Filemɔ waa nelbuɔ. U nuɔ Yesu maama‑i Pol yaa wulaa‑i aa hũu-ma. U waa tĩɛna Kolɔsi. Kɔraamba waa baa-yo. U kɔriɛŋo naŋo‑i ba taa ba bĩ-yo Onesimu. Onesimu ji gbar aa naa yaŋ-yo. Uŋ gbaraa dumaaŋo-na, yiiŋgu naŋgu-na u kã ka da Pol dii kaso‑i-na. Pol wuɔ piiye Yesu maama‑i baa-yo fuɔ wuɔ bi hũu-ma. 
\ip Huɔŋgu naŋgu juɔ hi, Pol wuɔ saaŋ-yo hã u yuntieŋo‑i baa-yo. Ku waa kɔriɛŋo maŋ duɔ gbar aa ba hi-yo bel-o, ba sa puona baa u kũɔma huolma‑i. Sɛbɛ daayo nyɛgɛ̃mmaŋ-yuŋgu yaa kufaŋgu‑i duɔ cãrã Filemɔ‑i wuɔ u ce jande aa u yaŋ Onesimu bir suur u dumɛlle-na, u baa gãŋ baa-yo, u yaŋ aa u bel-o fafamma kɛrɛ ba ciɛ baaduɔmba *Kirsa horre-na. 
\ip Pol hiiriiye u yalle‑i baa u jĩɛŋo‑i u sɛbɛ‑i-na. U sa guor-o, u sa kpakpaa-yo, u saa bi cie-yo wuɔ u baa ce kumaŋ saaya cemma Onesimu‑i-na. Ŋga Kirsa nelnyulmuŋ migãaŋ tĩɛnamma‑i dumaa, u piiye ma yaa da ma tĩɛnu u jĩɛŋo‑i baa bamaŋ ka kalaŋ sɛbɛ daayo‑i hiere. 
\c 1  
\s1 Jaaluŋgu 
\p  
\v 1 Muɔ Pol, ba bilaa-mi dii-mi kaso‑i-na Yesu-Kirsa maama-na. Muɔ baa mi natobiŋo‑i Timote‑i, miɛmɛi nyɛgãaŋ sɛbɛ daayo‑i diɛ hã-ni Filemɔ. Nuɔnɛi i jĩɛŋ nuɔ, nuɔnɛi i nabentieŋ nuɔ maacemmaŋ-hũmelle-na.  
\v 2 I bi nyɛgãaŋ-yo diɛ hã Diiloŋ-dũŋ-baamba maŋ tigiiŋ ŋ dumɛlle-na baa i tũɔ‑i Apiya‑i a naara Arsipe‑i fuɔ maŋ vaa u fɛrɛ tuɔ ce Diiloŋ-maacemma‑i baa-ye.  
\v 3 I To‑i Diiloŋo‑i, baa Itieŋo‑i Yesu-Kirsa‑i, ba kãyã-nɛi aa fɛ̃ na hɔmmu‑i. 
\s1 Pol nuɔ Filemɔ maama‑i 
\p  
\v 4-5 Filemɔ, niŋ dɔl Diiloŋ-dũŋ-baamba‑i dumaa, baa niŋ haa ŋ naŋga‑i Itieŋo‑i Yesu‑i-na dumaa, mi nuɔ-ma hiere. A ce dumaaŋo-na, da mi ta mi cãrã Diiloŋo‑i huɔŋgu huɔŋgu, mi ta mi jaal-o ŋ maama-na.  
\v 6 Mi cãrã Diiloŋo‑i wuɔ niŋ hũyãa u maama‑i i waa horre maŋ nuɔ‑i daade‑i, u yaŋ di ta di kã baa di yaaŋga, ku yaa *Kirsaŋ ciɛ ãnfafamma maŋ yiɛ, nuɔmba ka suɔ-ma.  
\v 7 Kpɔr, niŋ dɔl Diiloŋ-dũŋ-baamba‑i dumaa, ku fĩɛ ba hɔmmu‑i, a ce dumaaŋo-na ku dɔlaanu-miɛ cor aa tiraa dii sirɛiŋa miɛ. 
\s1 Pol cãarã Filemɔ‑i a hã Onesimu 
\p  
\v 8 Filemɔ, *Kirsa yerre-na mi gbãa guor-ni ŋ ce kumaŋ saaya cemma.  
\v 9 Ŋga mi niɛ da ku bɔyaa mi ne niŋ dɔl nuɔmba‑i dumaa, aa cãrã-niɛ ku yaa faa. Muɔ Pol, mi yaaŋga cãa, a naara kufaŋgu‑i ba diyaa-mi kaso Yesu-Kirsa maama-na.  
\v 10 Mi cãrã-niɛ da mi hã Onesimu\f + \fr 1:10 \ft Onesimu yuŋgu yaa wuɔ «fa wɛima».\f* yaa‑i. U nuɔ Kirsa maama‑i mi nuŋgu-na kaso‑i-na bande‑i-na aa hũu-ma, a ce dumaaŋo-na u ciɛ mi biɛŋo.  
\v 11 Dĩɛlũɔ‑i-na, u saa tuɔ fa wɛima u hã-ni, ŋga fiɛfiɛ‑i-na, u ka fa a hã nuɔŋo‑i aa bi fa hã muɔŋo‑i. 
\p  
\v 12 Mi saaŋ-yo da mi hã-ni, uu dii ŋaa mɛi fɛrɛŋ tãmmaŋ-wuoŋo  
\v 13 Miŋ yeŋ kaso‑i-na bande‑i-na *Neldɔdɔlma maama-na, mi taa mi taara mi jĩna-yuɔ mi caaŋ-nu u tuɔ ce mi maacemma‑i naŋ fuoŋgu-na.  
\v 14 Ŋga mi sa taara mi ce kumaŋ sa dɔlaanuŋ-niɛ. Mi sa taara mi guor-ni ŋ ce ãnfafamma hã-mi. Mi taara da ŋ'a ŋ ce kumaŋ hã-mi ku hel naŋ fɛrɛŋ huɔŋ-na. 
\p  
\v 15 Ku gbãa ce Onesimu furaaya ŋ caaŋgu-na da huɔŋgu cɛllɛ aa duɔ bir kã ka waa baa-ni gbula hai gbãa suɔ?  
\v 16 Gboluoŋ daaku-na, baa bel-o ŋaa kɔriɛgbãŋgbãlãŋo, bel-o ŋaa ŋ nelkpekpelŋo. U maama dii kpelle mi huɔŋga-na; ŋga uŋ kãŋ na da na ka tĩɛna baa na-naa, a naara naŋ tiraa na ye Itieŋo baaŋ namaa na hãi‑i-na, u maama saaya ma waa kpelle naŋ huɔŋga-na a yaŋ muɔŋo‑i.  
\v 17 Da ŋ ta ŋ kãŋ-mi ŋ jĩɛŋ muɔ, bel-o ŋaa niŋ bilaa muɔŋo‑i dumaa.  
\v 18 Da kuɔ u cãlãa-ni baa wɛima, sisɔ ŋ cɛ̃mɛlle dii-yuɔ, muɔmɛi ka pã-de hã-ni.  
\v 19 Muɔ Pol, muɔmɛi nyɛgãaŋ nel daama‑i baa mi fɛrɛŋ naŋga wuɔ mi ka suu u cɛ̃mɛlle‑i. Ŋga ŋ saaya ŋ suɔ wuɔ mɛi bi cɛ̃mɛlle dii nuɔŋo-na: Ŋ saaya ŋ pã ŋ fɛrɛ a hã-mi.\f + \fr 1:19 \ft Filemɔ hũyãa Yesu maama‑i Pol yaa wulaa‑i ku'i ciɛ Pol wuɔ u cɛ̃mɛlle dii-yuɔ.\f* 
\v 20 Mi natobiŋ nuɔ, jande, ne Itieŋo‑i aa ŋ ce-ma ŋaa miŋ waaŋ-ma dumaa; ne Kirsa‑i aa ŋ fɛ̃ mi huɔŋga‑i. 
\p  
\v 21 Miŋ yeŋ terieŋgu maŋ nuɔ‑i, mi suyaa wuɔ miŋ waaŋ mamaŋ baa-ni daama‑i ŋ ka ce-ma, aa tiraa suɔ wuɔ ŋ ka ce cor kufaŋgu‑i. 
\p  
\v 22 Naŋ cãrãŋ Diiloŋo‑i, mi suyaa miɛ mi ka da hũmelle‑i kã na wulaa, terieŋgu faŋgu-na, ta ŋ tigiiŋ mi muncɔmmu‑i ŋ cie-mi. 
\s1 Jaaluperieŋgu 
\p  
\v 23 Epafirasi pãa ŋ jaaluŋgu. Uu bi dii baa-mi kaso‑i-na Yesu-Kirsa maama'i nuɔ‑i.  
\v 24 Marke‑i baa Aritarke‑i baa Demasi‑i a naara Like‑i, bafamba dii baa-mi i tiɛ ce Diiloŋ-maacemma‑i, ba bi pãa ŋ jaaluŋgu.  
\v 25 Itieŋo‑i Yesu-Kirsa kãyã-nɛi.